                    },
                    "message": "look at line 230\n\n```\n229 \n230 static void recordDiscoveredIdentifiers(\n231     std::set<nlohmann::json>& usedNames, std::list<size_t>& indexes,\n232     const std::string& probeName, const nlohmann::json& record)\n```"
                },
